elds are not ",[315,771,772],{},"label",[315,774,775],{},"value",", set them with ",[315,778,779],{},"label-key",[315,781,782],{},"value-key",". Props of ",[315,785,786],{},"USelectMenu"," such as ",[315,789,790],{},"description-key"," work directly too; field names are inferred from ",[315,793,447],{},", and a wrong name is a type error.",[363,796],{"name":797},"select-menu-keys",[337,799,801],{"id":800},"search","Search",[312,803,804,805,808,809,811,812,815],{},"The menu has a built-in search input with the placeholder \"Search...\" (\"關鍵字查詢...\" in Traditional Chinese), which can be changed in ",[324,806,47],{"href":807},"\u002Fgetting-started\u002Ftheme\u002Fmessages#overridable-items",". The search matches the ",[315,810,779],{}," field and is not affected by the display format. With only a few items, pass ",[315,813,814],{},":search-input=\"false\""," to hide the search input.",[363,817],{"name":818},"select-menu-search",[337,820,822],{"id":821},"variants","Variants",[312,824,825,826,829,830,382,833,836,837,361],{},"Uses the ",[315,827,828],{},"variant",", ",[315,831,832],{},"color",[315,834,835],{},"highlight"," of ",[315,838,786],{},[363,840],{"name":841},"select-menu-variant",[337,843,845],{"id":844},"icon","Icon",[312,847,825,848,382,850,836,853,855,856,858,859,861],{},[315,849,844],{},[315,851,852],{},"trailing-icon",[315,854,786],{},"; ",[315,857,844],{}," shows on the left, and ",[315,860,852],{}," replaces the arrow on the right.",[363,863],{"name":864},"select-menu-icon",[337,866,868],{"id":867},"size-and-states","Size and states",[312,870,871,872,875],{},"While loading, a spinner replaces the arrow on the right and the menu is disabled. Switching to skeleton, disabled or loading closes an open menu, and it does not reopen afterwards. See ",[324,873,102],{"href":874},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Foverview\u002Fcommon"," for the behavior shared by all states.",[363,877],{"name":878},"select-menu-states",[332,880,882],{"id":881},"examples","Examples",[337,884,886],{"id":885},"with-form-validation","With form validation",[312,888,889,890,892,893,896,897,892,899,361],{},"An empty single selection is ",[315,891,352],{},", so use ",[315,894,895],{},"requiredText","; an empty multiple selection is ",[315,898,360],{},[315,900,901],{},"requiredArray",[363,903],{"name":904},"select-menu-validation",[337,906,908],{"id":907},"truncated-text-tooltip","Truncated text tooltip",[312,910,911,912,915,916,322,919,923],{},"When the selected text is wider than the field, it is truncated with an ellipsis, and a tooltip shows the full text on hover or focus, or on long press on touch devices (see ",[324,913,217],{"href":914},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Fhelper\u002Ftooltip#touch-long-press","); a long press does not open the menu. The tooltip is not shown while the menu is open. Set the width on ",[315,917,918],{},"ui.wrapper",[324,920,922],{"href":921},"#styling","Styling"," below.",[363,925],{"name":926},"select-menu-truncate",[337,928,930],{"id":929},"loading-items-asynchronously","Loading items asynchronously",[312,932,933,934,937,938,940,941,944],{},"While fetching items from the back end, use ",[315,935,936],{},"loading"," to show a spinner and disable the menu, then fill in ",[315,939,447],{}," when the request completes. When the bound value has no matching item, ",[315,942,943],{},"placeholder"," is shown, and the label appears automatically once the items arrive.",[363,946],{"name":947},"select-menu-async",[337,949,951],{"id":950},"dependent-menus","Dependent menus",[312,953,954,955,957],{},"When the city changes, the district is cleared, and the district ",[315,956,447],{}," are computed from the city.",[363,959],{"name":960},"select-menu-cascade",[337,962,964],{"id":963},"opening-the-menu","Opening the menu",[312,966,967,968,971,972,975],{},"Get the trigger button through ",[315,969,970],{},"triggerRef"," on the template ref and call ",[315,973,974],{},"click()"," to open the menu.",[363,977],{"name":978},"select-menu-expose",[332,980,